# ---- WordPress-era dates recovered from the old.elegantize.com sitemap
#      (18 Feb 2026 snapshot). Never present in the Search Console export,
#      so the generated map could not see them. Same date-drift shape as above.
#      Gate-checked: source not canonical, target canonical, no chain, no dupe.
RewriteRule ^2024/03/05/6-classic-decor-new-york-decor-ideas-for-new-york-weddings/?$ /blog/6-classic-decor-new-york-decor-ideas-for-new-york-weddings [R=301,L]
